-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §74 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה: a principal
-- placed at a whole grade has spent 0 years in it, at an intermediate grade
-- a year and a half; the first promotion is §68's, the criteria fitted to
-- the time left; and the worked example of a 120% principal at level 3.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `70`
IMPORT `72`

§ `74 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה`

-- akn:art_74__para_a The opening of (א): at the placement of §71, (1)–(2).

@ref akn:art_74__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_74__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years a principal is taken to have spent at placement` grade IS
    IF FLOOR grade EQUALS grade THEN 0 ELSE 1.5

-- (ב): the first promotion is §68's; from an intermediate grade, §68(ב)'s
-- criteria fitted to the time left.
@ref akn:art_74__para_b
`the first promotion after conversion follows section 68` MEANS TRUE

-- The example (¶2–¶15): 120%, level 3, T = 15,000. X = 15,000 / 120% =
-- 12,500; A = 14,375; placed at 14,819 (grade 1); B = 17,250; C = 2,431;
-- 2,431 / 14,819 = 16.4%.
@ref akn:art_74__para_b/p2 akn:art_74__para_b/p3 akn:art_74__para_b/p4 akn:art_74__para_b/p5 akn:art_74__para_b/p6 akn:art_74__para_b/p7 akn:art_74__para_b/p8 akn:art_74__para_b/p9 akn:art_74__para_b/p10 akn:art_74__para_b/p11 akn:art_74__para_b/p12 akn:art_74__para_b/p13 akn:art_74__para_b/p14 akn:art_74__para_b/p15
#ASSERT 15000 DIVIDED BY 1.2 EQUALS 12500
#ASSERT `a principal's A` (15000 DIVIDED BY 1.2) EQUALS 14375
#ASSERT 15000 TIMES 1.15 MINUS 14819 EQUALS 2431
#ASSERT ROUND (1000 TIMES `the personal supplement rate` 15000 15 14819) EQUALS 164
#ASSERT `years a principal is taken to have spent at placement` 1.5 EQUALS 1.5
